> Is there any chance that this will be available in the near future?
> I'm currently struggling to find the correct values of the hash parameters
> for PasTeX for the Commodore Amiga, and OzTeX on the Mac. I think PasTeX
> has the hash size set at compile time, so its not that easy to change.
> I need a definitive answer on the sizes before asking the author to make the
> necessary changes.
>
>
> The new LaTeX2e distribution seems very powerful, but eats memory and runs
> more slowly. The price of progress, I suppose.
