Dean

I found that latex2e needed a larger hash size in OzTeX and I run with a
value of 10,000 (it may run in less), I just choose an arbitary value.

I also discovered that the default values for other parameters are too small,
I could not load all the fonts I needed.

It is slower but changing to documentclass from documentstyle shows a distinct
improvement (but can introduce other problems).

